{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/guidance/register-to-complete-origin-declarations-under-the-uk-india-free-trade-agreement","content_id":"514352d0-ff3e-490b-a7e8-4ca80ad85eea","description":"Register with HMRC if you're planning to complete origin declarations for exports under the UK-India Free Trade Agreement.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><h2 id=\"who-needs-to-register\">Who needs to register</h2>\n\n<p>You need to register with HMRC if both of the following apply:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>you’re a UK producer or exporter exporting goods originating in the UK to India</li>\n  <li>you plan to <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/uk-india-ceta-origin-declaration\">complete origin declarations</a> under the UK-India Free Trade Agreement</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The agreement allows you to self-certify origin, instead of having to obtain an origin certificate from a competent authority each time you send a consignment of goods to India.</p>\n\n<p>You can continue to export to India without origin declarations if either:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>your goods do not qualify for preferential tariffs</li>\n  <li>you choose not to use the UK-India Free Trade Agreement</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Your goods may be subject to non-preferential tariff rates if you do not use origin declarations.</p>\n\n<p>Find out <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.business.gov.uk/campaign/alive-with-opportunity/the-uk-india-trade-deal/rules-of-origin\">how UK exporting businesses can qualify for preferential tariffs</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"what-youll-need\">What you’ll need</h2>\n\n<p>You’ll need:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>the <abbr title=\"Economic Operators Registration and Identification\">EORI</abbr> number that we have on record for your business</li>\n  <li>your business or trading name</li>\n  <li>a primary email address and up to 10 additional email addresses — you can use any of these to send origin declarations to the customs authority of India</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>You can only register these email addresses with one <abbr title=\"Economic Operators Registration and Identification\">EORI</abbr> number to complete origin declarations under the UK-India Free Trade Agreement.</p>\n\n<p>If you register an email address with multiple <abbr title=\"Economic Operators Registration and Identification\">EORI</abbr> numbers, the customs authority of India may:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>not be able to authenticate the consignment</li>\n  <li>reject any origin declarations relating to these <abbr title=\"Economic Operators Registration and Identification\">EORI</abbr> numbers</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>If this happens, the importer in India will not be able to claim a preferential tariff.</p>\n\n<div role=\"note\" aria-label=\"Information\" class=\"application-notice info-notice\">\n  <p>We will share your details with the customs authority of India to authenticate each consignment exported under the free trade agreement. Read about how we protect data and process personal information in <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/data-protection-act-dpa-information-hm-revenue-and-customs-hold-about-you\">HMRC’s Privacy Notice</a>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"register-online\">Register online</h2>\n\n<p>You’ll need to sign in to register online. If you do not already have sign in details, you’ll be able to create them.</p>\n\n<p><a class=\"gem-c-button govuk-button govuk-button--start\" role=\"button\" data-module=\"govuk-button\" data-ga4-attributes='{\"event_name\":\"navigation\",\"type\":\"start button\"}' draggable=\"false\" href=\"https://www.tax.service.gov.uk/submissions/new-form/register-to-make-origin-declarations-under-the-uk-india-free-trade-agreement\"><span> Register now </span><svg class=\"govuk-button__start-icon govuk-!-display-none-print\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17.5\" height=\"19\" viewbox=\"0 0 33 40\" focusable=\"false\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M0 0h13l20 20-20 20H0l20-20z\"></path></svg></a></p>\n\n<div role=\"note\" aria-label=\"Information\" class=\"application-notice info-notice\">\n  <p>Online services may be slow during busy times. Check if there are any <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/register-to-complete-origin-declarations-under-the-uk-india-free-trade-agreement-service-availability-and-issues\">problems with this service</a>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"after-youve-registered\">After you’ve registered</h2>\n\n<p>With every consignment of goods that you send, you must <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/uk-india-ceta-origin-declaration\">complete Origin Declaration Template</a> and send it to both of the following:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>email customs authority of India: <a href=\"cbic.customs.indiaukceta@CBICIndia.onmicrosoft.com\">cbic.customs.indiaukceta@CBICIndia.onmicrosoft.com</a>\n</li>\n  <li>importer in India</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>From July 2026 you can also use this service to:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>change your registration details</li>\n  <li>cancel your registration</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The 'Register online' section has been updated to include a link to the service availability page, allowing you to check if there are any problems with the service.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-24T13:43:20Z"},{"note":"Updated 2 links to the origin declaration template and added the email address of where to send the template.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-14T15:55:50Z"},{"note":"A link has been added to explain how UK exporting businesses can qualify for preferential tariffs under the UK–India Free Trade Agreement.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-24T14:37:07Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-15T16:51:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["6667cce2-e809-4e21-ae09-cb0bdc1ddda3"],"first_public_at":"2026-01-15T16:51:00.000+00:00","headers":[{"id":"who-needs-to-register","level":2,"text":"Who needs to register"},{"id":"what-youll-need","level":2,"text":"What you’ll need"},{"id":"register-online","level":2,"text":"Register online"},{"id":"after-youve-registered","level":2,"text":"After you’ve registered"}],"political":false,"related_mainstream_content":[],"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"detailed_guide","first_published_at":"2026-01-15T16:51:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/guidance/register-to-complete-origin-declarations-under-the-uk-india-free-trade-agreement.cy","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/guidance/register-to-complete-origin-declarations-under-the-uk-india-free-trade-agreement.cy","base_path":"/guidance/register-to-complete-origin-declarations-under-the-uk-india-free-trade-agreement.cy","content_id":"514352d0-ff3e-490b-a7e8-4ca80ad85eea","document_type":"detailed_guide","links":{},"locale":"cy","public_updated_at":"2026-07-24T13:43:20Z","schema_name":"detailed_guide","title":"Cofrestrwch i gwblhau datganiadau tarddiad o dan Gytundeb Masnach Rydd y DU ac India","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/register-to-complete-origin-declarations-under-the-uk-india-free-trade-agreement.cy","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/guidance/register-to-complete-origin-declarations-under-the-uk-india-free-trade-agreement","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/guidance/register-to-complete-origin-declarations-under-the-uk-india-free-trade-agreement","base_path":"/guidance/register-to-complete-origin-declarations-under-the-uk-india-free-trade-agreement","content_id":"514352d0-ff3e-490b-a7e8-4ca80ad85eea","document_type":"detailed_guide","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-24T13:43:20Z","schema_name":"detailed_guide","title":"Register to complete origin declarations under the UK-India Free Trade Agreement","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/register-to-complete-origin-declarations-under-the-uk-india-free-trade-agreement","withdrawn":false}],"government":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/